// The approach from attempt 9 (best so far) was correct: detect natural "<<", constrain content,
// close immediately on completion. But 57% syntax because content fails parser.
//
// The issue: parser rejects variable-name tokens. When parser has no valid next tokens
// (only EOS), the constrained step returns EOS immediately, leaving empty content.
